# Supabase — https://supabase.com (free tier). Same rule as the sibling
# EV-charging project: used for users/trips/chat/ratings/etc., never for
# data that belongs somewhere else.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# eKYC — DigiLocker decided (blueprint §08, the only genuinely free option).
# Real access needs a Partner Organization registration via API Setu first —
# an approval process, not an instant key. No env vars needed until that's
# granted; the app runs on a manual-review stub until then.

# AdMob — app IDs are already set directly in app.json (Google's published
# test IDs, safe to ship). This is only for the banner *ad unit* ID, which
# needs a real AdMob account + app registration to get — falls back to
# Google's test banner unit automatically if unset.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ADMOB_BANNER_UNIT_ID=

# Grievance Officer (IT Rules 2021, blueprint §05) — optional; the app
# shows a "not yet assigned" placeholder if unset. Swap the real name/
# contact in here, no code change needed.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GRIEVANCE_OFFICER_NAME=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GRIEVANCE_OFFICER_PHONE=
